window.products.push({"id":599003,"name":"Lovinland 2pcs 4th of July Gnomes Decorations for 4th of July Memorial Day Decor Red White and Blue Patriotic Gnomes Scandinavian Swedish Tomte Elf Dw","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ym8MbSQOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GREAT GIFTS FOR YOUR FRIENDS: Our gnome gifts is regarded as good luck and it is also the perfect home decoration. It is a great gift to bring good luck to families and friends or your new usa citizenship friend, co-worker. Are you looking for a surprised and meaningful christmas present for your beloved wife, husband, father, mother, daughter, son and co-worker, employee who has just become a US Citizen, passed the US Citizens exam or has just naturalized This is cool gift for them at the citizenship ceremony and express their happiness and proud to be American.You'll love them. ADORABLE PATRIOTIC DECORATIONS - Gnome is a mythological creature from Scandinavian folklore. According to Scandinavian tradition, The Swedish elf gnome represents good luck brings good luck to families. This adorable Patriotic Gnome Couple are all decked out for Veterans Day /4th of July/American Independence Day/Memorial Day/American President Election Decoration. PREMIUM QUALITY & HANDCRAFTED Gnomes Decorations For Home - The Fourth of July Gnomes are made of soft felt, plush nose, fiber white beard, and hat for posing. The sand at the bottom of each gnome adds weight which makes the gnome sit nicely anywhere! Gnomes are handcrafted, so each one will have some differences in size and weight. PERFECT SIZE - Each package includes 2 Fourth of July Gnomes. Each gnome is 6.7 inches high from the hat to the leg and 5.1 inches wide. It is perfect your home desk shelf decor.All faceless dolls are designed with white, red, and blue as the main colors, which are perfectly close to the colors of the American flag, adding a patriotic atmosphere. PERFECT HOLIDAY DECOR: This little gnome decor adds the perfect holiday touch to your patriotic décor. It is perfect to be used at occasions like American President Election Decorations, 4th of July decorations, Veterans Day, Memorial Day, American Independence Day, GOD BLESS AMERICA!!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ym8MbSQOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lovinland","source_asin":"B0BJQ3NJV7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-599003","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJQ3NJV7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJQ3NJV7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
