window.products.push({"id":599121,"name":"Magnetic Poetry - German Kit - Words for Refrigerator - Write Poems and Letters on the Fridge - Made in the USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gx1XjWk0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Magnetic Poetry German Kit was developed by bilingual fans of Magnetic Poetry and comes with a mini-translation guide. CONTAINS - over 500 magnetic word tiles in a cute, colorful, giftable 4.5 x 6.5 inch box. Rearrange the words to write poems, messages to your roommates, or generative esoteric word art masterpieces whose meaning is lost even to you. Magnetic Poetry is both a creative writing aid, and just a really fun and limitless toy. They're not just fridge words, you can write an ode on your commode, an elegy on your doorknob, a haiku on your car hood, or a novelette on your omelette maker. MIX AND MATCH WITH OTHER KITS - Tile height is 0.375 Inches, compatible with nearly all other Magnetic Poetry sets. With dozens of other themed kits, the possibilities are endless. You can mix and match to create custom combinations, and custom gift ideas. Magnet words make a great dorm room accessory, or locker decoration. They're also a perfect gift for poetry lovers, or a gift for writers of any kind, and as a graduation present, you can't go wrong. MADE IN THE USA - Magnetic Poetry sets are made in America, are nontoxic, and comply with all American and international safety guidelines and regulations. Magnetic Poetry is the inventor of the magnetic word tile, and we're still a small US company that takes great pride in every set we make. Read more about our company in the product description below. OVER 100 DIFFERENT SETS - Please click on the Magnetic Poetry brand name below the title of this page to browse other sets made by us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gx1XjWk0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magnetic Poetry","source_asin":"1890560251","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-599121","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/1890560251","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"1890560251","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":599122,"name":"Dough Mixer with Fermentation Function for Home Kitchen, Smart Touch Panel, 5 QT 230W Multifunctional Dough Machine with Kneading Knife for Pasta, Bak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+CrRcHvML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【STAND MIXER】Made of food grade stainless steel, 5 QT bowl provides enough mixing capacity. 1~5L of dough can be mixed at a time. The COOKMII dough maker is a satisfying gift for partners and friends. 【Intelligent & Touch Panel】 Microcomputer timing intelligent kneading program, saves worry and effort. The easy-to-operate touch buttons allow you to adjust the time setting in four gears, allowing you to choose the flexibility of the dough and control the entire process without supervision. Humanized operation, no need to bend over, making the dough easier and less labor-intensive. 【Comprehensive Design and Low Noise】Easy to install and remove. 304 stainless steel basin and kneading blade, more convenient to use and clean. A splash guard keeps dry ingredients from dust and batter splatters. Non-slip silicone suction cups keep the blender stable and safe during operation, avoiding movement or bouncing to reduce noise. In order to create a better experience, the generated noise has been repeatedly tested and adjusted to below 60db. 【Easy to Operate & Safer to Use】Touch selection to automatically knead the dough, with overload and overheating protection design, the bottom of the fuselage can convect cold and hot air to dissipate heat, and has a long service life. Built-in 230w high-quality pure copper high-performance motor, the dough mixer can handle hard dough well. The perfect combination of simplicity, performance and style, the machine mixes ingredients efficiently and thoroughly. Speed: 130r/min-210/min. 【COOKMII Worry-Free After Sales】Have confidence in the quality of KICHOT kneading machine, we can provide a complete five-year quality guarantee. Package includes: dough maker, lid, kneading blade, bowl and user manual. We value every customer and want to do better. If you have any questions, please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+CrRcHvML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cookmii","source_asin":"B09CGQ5L1T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-599122","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CGQ5L1T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CGQ5L1T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
