window.products.push({"id":599540,"name":"3 Inch Full / Double Size Accu-Gold 5.3 Visco Elastic Memory Foam Mattress Topper Made in the USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518caYYariL._AC_.jpg","description":"For those of you looking for higher quality, better performance, and a premium comfort we have created Accu-Gold. The finest visco elastic memory foam in the bedding market today is Accu-Gold. Our Gold Formula is custom engineered for the ultimate performance offered by any visco elastic memory foam for superior support and pressure relieving comfort that will out perform any visco elastic memory foam product you may have considered before. Accu-Gold provides pressure point relief and support that is beyond the realm of other visco elastic memory foam products. Accu-Gold will provide you with superior pressure point relief not found in other visco elastic memory foam products on the bedding market today. The most problematic pressure points such as your hips and shoulders will receive up to an 80% percent reduction in pressure fatigue when compared in side by side tests with competing bedding and mattress products. The Accu-Gold difference is in the engineering. Accu-Gold has been designed with an open cell structure; therefore, air flows through the golden struts at a higher rate than other visco elastic memory foams on the market today. This will cause excess heat and moisture to be wicked away which will equate to even less discomfort and fatigue caused by older visco elastic memory foam products. Accu-Gold is more supportive and will make you feel like you are floating in a sea of liquid gold. All our Memory Foam Mattress Toppers are made using Memory Foam produced in the USA, they are manufactured in our own factories, and are competitively priced while not compromising on quality. We do not import any of our memory foam products as we believe that US guidelines have an impact on quality and longevity. A visco elastic memory mattress topper from Accutex Foam USA could be the answer to your sleep problems.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518caYYariL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Accutex Foam USA","source_asin":"B00BWAYHZG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-599540","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BWAYHZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BWAYHZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":599541,"name":"Fundraising For A Cause | 250 Love is Love Rainbow Pride Stickers - LGBTQ Pride Rainbow Stickers on a Roll (250 Stickers)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61INmqQHYQL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"LOVE IS LOVE STICKERS: These 'Love Is Love' rainbow heart stickers are square-shaped. These stickers are wonderful for planners, journals, sketchbooks, and folders. Display this sticker to show support and raise awareness for the LGBTQ community. STICKER SPECIFICATIONS: Our wholesale 'Love Is Love' features a heart with a pride rainbow in the background. Each sticker is 2 inches by 2 inches. This roll has 250 stickers. PRIDE MONTH: June is Pride Month! During Pride Month people commemorate the Stonewall Riots that took place in 1969. Use these low-priced pride 'Love Is Love' stickers to wear during pride parades, pride marches, LGBTQ+ themed parties, support group meetings, and other pride events. LGBTQ PRIDE PRODUCTS: Our bulk LGBTQ+ pride sticker rolls are perfect to use when creating pride-themed crafts for pride parades, gay pride parties, same-sex weddings and LGBTQ+ fundraisers. Use our rainbow stickers to start conversations about the need for equal rights for LGBTQ community. USA BASED COMPANY: Fundraising For A Cause was founded in 2005 after our founder Karen Conroy's sister was diagnosed with Breast Cancer. She saw how many people and organizations struggled to raise money and awareness for different causes. She came up with the idea of selling awareness products as a way to generate money for these organizations. Our state of the art 15,000 square foot warehouse located in Tampa, FL is stocked with over 6,500 different awareness products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61INmqQHYQL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fundraising For A Cause","source_asin":"B07HJDJQ4B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-599541","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HJDJQ4B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HJDJQ4B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
