window.products.push({"id":599543,"name":"Trippy Tapestry Psychedelic Mountain - Magic Mushroom Wall Hanging Multiple Colorful Hippie Tapestries Art Window Treatments Valance Bedroom Decor Liv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-LYDYQs9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【HIGH QUALITY POLYESTER】This psychedelic tapestry is made with 100% premium polyester for a soft. Our trippy tapestry retains softness for a lifetime and resists fading. Art tapestry is stable in size, small shrinkage rate, basically non-deformable, straight and not wrinkled. Easy to clean, fast drying features. And you can also use color-changing led light to shine on it, you will get a magical effect. Amazing surprise. 【WALL TAPESTRY & EASY INSTALL】There are 4 sizes to choose:Small- W37.4\"×H28.7\"(95cm×73cm); Medium- W59.1\"×H51.2\"(150cm×130cm); Large- W78.7\"×H59.1\"(200cm×152cm); XL- H70.8\" × W90.5\"(180cm× 230cm). And also available in your choice of colors. The package is equipped with 2 barb clips and 3 no trace hooks. You only need to fix the two ends of the wall blanket tapestry to the wall. It is easy to install and will not damage the wall. 【EASY CARE & CLEANING】Machine washable in cold water and tumble dry on low. Fade, stain, shrink and wrinkle resistant. Ironing at low temperature, do not bleach. Our colorful tapestry wall hanging is environmentally friendly. 【ECO-FRIENDLY & QUALITY CERTIFIED STANDARD】The fabric is thoroughly tested for meeting performance like no pilling, shrinkage, color fastness, tear strength and thread count authenticity before being individually measured and stitched to perfection. Recommended for regular wash and short dry cycles for superior softness. Click the “Add to Cart” button at the top of this page now to light up your life by the trippy psychedelic tapestry. 【MULTIPLE OPTIONS:】You can use it as a curtain, ceiling, bedspread, picnic blanket, shower curtain, furniture covers, sofa cover, car roof decoration and party decoration. This hippie mushroom tapestry is spectacular. You can hang it on the wall in the bedroom. The colors are vibrant. Would love to just step into that world. Our designs match any décor and are a wonderful gift idea. If you have any questions about our products, we can always help, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-LYDYQs9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEEMONIK","source_asin":"B08D78T2M2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-599543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D78T2M2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D78T2M2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
