window.products.push({"id":599556,"name":"CR Gibson Lolita 15-Inch Hostess Tray, Girl's Night In","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.57,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+WhSBy9-L._AC_.jpg","description":"Lolita's exclusive designs decorate a wide variety of party ware that is perfect to use outside, inside, on the go, or at home - anywhere, anytime! Lolita says: \"Every woman has a gift, a talent that makes them special and unique. Find that talent and you've found your passion for life. Follow that passion, allow it to grow and be fully realized, and you've found success. I'm lucky because I've found my passion; my wish for every woman out there is that they will find theirs.\" As a designer, Lolita sees something quite extraordinary in the everyday and ordinary of life. She brings her vision into her products as a reflection of the Lolita lifestyle. It's a balance of fun, entertaining and celebrating moments with the special people in our lives. Whether you're having girlfriends over for margaritas or hosting a family get together, Lolita serveware, drinkware, hostess aprons and kitchen textiles are the perfect elements to create a memorable occasion indoors or outdoors. There's only one Lolita! Lolita is brought to you by CR Gibson, synonymous with quality for more than 140 years. Starting with the creation of the very first baby book in 1898, families around the world have depended on CR Gibson as their number one provider of products that celebrate life's most cherished moments. Understanding the importance of preservation and craftsmanship, CR Gibson products offer a tradition of excellence and quality. CR Gibson's commitment to excellence can also be seen in their commitment to design. CR Gibson sets a standard for style that reflects today's top fashions while creating a timeless treasured keepsake.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+WhSBy9-L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"C.R. Gibson","source_asin":"B007CWXP7E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-599556","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007CWXP7E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007CWXP7E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
