window.products.push({"id":599560,"name":"Multifunction Kitchen Shears Come Apart Dishwasher Safe Food Scissors Heavy Duty 6-In-1, Easy Wash with Magnetic Holder, for Food, Meat, Fish and Vege","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CsM7t27YL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Discover the difference between disassembled kitchen scissors: With a non-slip ergonomic handle that gives you an excellent grip, this tool can be used safely by everyone in the family and is comfortable for either right or left-handed cooks. It's also up to everyone's needs and makes your cooking experience stress-free. It can be used as a Bottle Opener for those fun family barbecues, as a Nutcracker for chefs with a taste for exotic mixes or just nutty flavored foods. It also holds a Fruit & Veggie Digger and a Fruit & Veggie Peeler for the healthy eaters. Enjoy the best fishing trips with its Fish Scale remover, or go camping and use the super sharp cutting blades, to easily cut Chicken, Poultry, Fish, Meat, Vegetables, and Herb Specification: Material:stainless steel+PP+PR Product size inches::8.9 * 3.1 inches Color :Green Package Includes : kitchen shears x 1 Magnetic Houder x 1 Notice: 1.Scissors are very sharp, please be careful to use. 2.Keep the scissors out of the reach of children. 3.Please wipe with a dry towel to clean up it. 4.Please do not bake the scissors directly with fire or put it in water for too long. Here are some tips you can follow to maintain your scissors： After every use, wash with soap and hot water. Make sure to reach the area between the blade and the handle. Dry scissors by hand with a clean towel immediately after washing especially the hard-to-reach areas. We recommend washing by hand and keeping the kitchen scissors dry after washing so that the blades can keep sharp.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CsM7t27YL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09PZDN4KW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-599560","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PZDN4KW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PZDN4KW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
