window.products.push({"id":599824,"name":"Arlee Chenille Geometric Chair Pads with Tiebacks (Set of 2), Burgundy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lukWbj0SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The chenille geometric chair pads with tiebacks, set of 2, burgundy can be used year round. Made in China, filled and finished in USA. This updated ironwork design is woven with chenille yarns; looks great in casual and formal rooms throughout the house. Flip the pad over for a completely new look - reverse side is made from a coordinating solid color suede. Full length ties help to keep chair pad firmly in place. Durable, long wearing fabrics and Lock stitch seams help ensure this pad will last for a long time. Filled with high-resiliency, high-loft polyester fiber for added comfort and support. Cover: 100% polyester, fill: 100% polyester fiber from reprocessed plastic bottles. Spot clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lukWbj0SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Arlee","source_asin":"B01B7GT1FK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-599824","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01B7GT1FK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01B7GT1FK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
